        "name": "Trajector",
        "username": "Trajector",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-17T02:26:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We just got OblivAeon and were laying out heroes for our first game........</p><p>The \"Completionist Guise\" card that came in the Ultimate Collector's Case is sleeving Justice Comics and says on the back, \"These are from an&nbsp;<em><strong>extremely</strong></em> limited print run.\"</p><p>The \"Completionist Guise\" card that came in the complete hero variant collection is sleeving the Freedom Five Annual OblivAeon edition, and says on the back, \"Some of these have minor variations in the covers that make them&nbsp;<em><strong>really</strong></em> valuable!\"</p><p>The \"Completionist Guise\" card that came in our fifth anniversary foil hero collection is sleeving an XTREEEEME issue of Prime Wardens and says on the back, \"I'm going to need like...<strong><em>a million dollars</em></strong> for these.\"</p><p>Adam wouldn't make any&nbsp;<strong><em>more</em></strong> variations on him to foster a crazy completionist trading ring, would he??!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:42.983Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
