        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-17T04:36:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Guise is the only card to differ between the 5th Anniversary Foil Collection and the Complete Hero Variant Collection.</p>\n<p>He’s also the only card with the same “base” artwork between the complete collections and the first-run variant printing (the one that came in the Big Box).</p>\n<p>But we’ve never known until now! We’ve only had the foil!</p>\n<p>I’m just curious if they seeded other variations of him out there among everyone.  Then we can blame any and all shipping delays on Guise. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:54:05.549Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
