        "read": false,
        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Guise is the only card to differ between the 5th Anniversary Foil Collection and the Complete Hero Variant Collection.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHe's also the only card with the same \"base\" artwork between the complete collections and the first-run variant printing (the one that came in the Big Box).\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBut we've never known until now! We've only had the foil!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI'm just curious if they seeded other variations of him out there among everyone.  Then we can blame any and all shipping delays on Guise. ;)",
